&quot;font-weight: inherit;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;eujQNb&quot;&gt;actions, projects, or functionalities&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;the team builds to move the needle on the key results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-wiz-uids=&quot;PGgEJe_13,PGgEJe_14&quot; class=&quot;uJ19be notranslate&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap; position: relative;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;class=PGgEJe_12/TKHnVd&quot; data-animation-atomic=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;vKEkVd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;button style=&quot;margin: 0px 6px 0px 0px; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial; border-radius: 10px; height: 20px; padding: 0px; width: 28px; position: relative; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwi-0YDKg7WSAxVa7zgGHUgcOvQQye0OegQIBBAC&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;disabled=PGgEJe_12/C5gNJc;aria-label=PGgEJe_12/bOjMyf;class=PGgEJe_12/UpSNec&quot; class=&quot;rBl3me&quot; aria-label=&quot;View related links&quot; data-icl-uuid=&quot;e5ecd008-46a5-4105-a2f1-ced995d1280c&quot; data-amic=&quot;true&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; transform: rotate(135deg);&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;wiMplc ofC0Ud&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; height=&quot;12px&quot; width=&quot;12px&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 3px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71 0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;Fsg96&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-block: 24px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; margin-inline: 0px;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; class=&quot;otQkpb&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#003366&quot;&gt;2. How They Work Together&lt;span style=&quot;visibility: hidden;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-wiz-uids=&quot;PGgEJe_1b,PGgEJe_1c&quot; class=&quot;txxDge notranslate&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap; position: relative;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;class=PGgEJe_1a/TKHnVd&quot; data-animation-atomic=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;vKEkVd&quot;&gt;&lt;button style=&quot;margin: 0px 6px 0px 0px; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial; border-radius: 10px; height: 20px; padding: 0px; width: 28px; position: relative; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwi-0YDKg7WSAxVa7zgGHUgcOvQQye0OegQIBRAA&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;disabled=PGgEJe_1a/C5gNJc;aria-label=PGgEJe_1a/bOjMyf;class=PGgEJe_1a/UpSNec&quot; class=&quot;rBl3me&quot; aria-label=&quot;View related links&quot; data-icl-uuid=&quot;c16fcf2f-df73-47a4-a624-7a2d844f4e0f&quot; data-amic=&quot;true&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; transform: rotate(135deg);&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;wiMplc ofC0Ud&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; height=&quot;12px&quot; width=&quot;12px&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 3px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71 0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 12px 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; padding-inline-start: 16px; font-weight: 400;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;KsbFXc U6u95&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAYQAA&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;T286Pc&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#003366&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bolder;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot;&gt;Prioritization:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Roadmaps are no longer just lists of features; they are prioritized based on which features most directly impact the OKRs. If a feature does not help achieve an OKR, it should not be on the roadmap.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAYQAQ&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;T286Pc&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#003366&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bolder;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot;&gt;Context for Delivery:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Roadmaps provide a timeline, which gives the &quot;when&quot; to the &quot;what&quot; and &quot;why&quot; of the OKRs.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; padding-inline-start: 4px;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAYQAg&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#003366&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;T286Pc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bolder;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot;&gt;Strategic Alignment:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;OKRs ensure that the roadmap is not just delivering features for the sake of it, but rather solving user problems that contribute to business goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-wiz-uids=&quot;PGgEJe_1o,PGgEJe_1p&quot; class=&quot;uJ19be notranslate&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap; position: relative;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;class=PGgEJe_1n/TKHnVd&quot; data-animation-atomic=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;vKEkVd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;button style=&quot;margin: 0px 6px 0px 0px; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial; border-radius: 10px; height: 20px; padding: 0px; width: 28px; position: relative; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwi-0YDKg7WSAxVa7zgGHUgcOvQQye0OegQIBhAD&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;disabled=PGgEJe_1n/C5gNJc;aria-label=PGgEJe_1n/bOjMyf;class=PGgEJe_1n/UpSNec&quot; class=&quot;rBl3me&quot; aria-label=&quot;View related links&quot; data-icl-uuid=&quot;7768d710-00c7-44a2-bdb5-262735860db1&quot; data-amic=&quot;true&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: inline-block; transform: rotate(135deg);&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;wiMplc ofC0Ud&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; height=&quot;12px&quot; width=&quot;12px&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 3px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71 0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71