&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; height=&quot;12px&quot; width=&quot;12px&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 3px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71 0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-block: 12px 16px; margin-inline: 0px; font-weight: 400;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAgQAA&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;Y3BBE&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#003366&quot;&gt;Between the high-level OKRs and the specific roadmap features, there are&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bolder;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot;&gt;initiatives&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-wiz-uids=&quot;PGgEJe_22,PGgEJe_23&quot; class=&quot;uJ19be notranslate&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap; position: relative;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;class=PGgEJe_21/TKHnVd&quot; data-animation-atomic=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;vKEkVd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;button style=&quot;margin: 0px 6px 0px 0px; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial; border-radius: 10px; height: 20px; padding: 0px; width: 28px; position: relative; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwi-0YDKg7WSAxVa7zgGHUgcOvQQye0OegQICBAB&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;disabled=PGgEJe_21/C5gNJc;aria-label=PGgEJe_21/bOjMyf;class=PGgEJe_21/UpSNec&quot; class=&quot;rBl3me&quot; aria-label=&quot;View related links&quot; data-icl-uuid=&quot